    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3251270/extras/06f3ac333ddb59c8b0da38458d0e3a6b.avif?t=1736214735\" width=616 height=72 /></span>\u00a0Evil reigns in the world, most of the human kingdoms are enslaved by the forces of darkness, and those that remain are defending with their last strength. People make up legends about ancient artifacts called &quot;Onems&quot;. It is said that if you collect them all, then you can gain complete control over the forces of darkness. There are rumors that this is just a fairy tale to calm people down.\u00a0The witch Erika will have to find the missing sisters and face difficulties face to face.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3251270/extras/f5e57d460dc632c0788a5e77c1e0ea2c.avif?t=1736214735\" width=616 height=72 /></span>\u00a0A classic action RPG with IDLE elements. You will have to defeat many monsters, grow plants, collect various items and practice potions. You are free to go where you want and do what you want, the game has a semi-open world system, so you are not limited in actions. In addition to all of the above, there is a huge amount of sexual content and profanity in the game, so this game is not suitable for people with a weak mentality! 18+</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3251270/extras/06f3ac333ddb59c8b0da38458d0e3a6b.avif?t=1736214735\" width=616 height=72 /></span>\u00a0Evil reigns in the world, most of the human kingdoms are enslaved by the forces of darkness, and those that remain are defending with their last strength. People make up legends about ancient artifacts called &quot;Onems&quot;. It is said that if you collect them all, then you can gain complete control over the forces of darkness. There are rumors that this is just a fairy tale to calm people down.\u00a0The witch Erika will have to find the missing sisters and face difficulties face to face.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3251270/extras/f5e57d460dc632c0788a5e77c1e0ea2c.avif?t=1736214735\" width=616 height=72 /></span>\u00a0A classic action RPG with IDLE elements. You will have to defeat many monsters, grow plants, collect various items and practice potions. You are free to go where you want and do what you want, the game has a semi-open world system, so you are not limited in actions. In addition to all of the above, there is a huge amount of sexual content and profanity in the game, so this game is not suitable for people with a weak mentality! 18+</p>",
